<h2>Schedule Updated</h2>
<p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
<p>The schedule for your team has been updated. Please check for changes to your shifts.</p>
<div class="detail">
  <strong>Schedule:</strong> {{scheduleName}}<br>
  <strong>Period:</strong> {{startDate}} – {{endDate}}
  {{#if changesSummary}}
  <br><strong>Changes:</strong> {{changesSummary}}
  {{/if}}
</div>
{{#if link}}
<p><a href="{{link}}" class="btn">View Updated Schedule</a></p>
{{/if}}
<p>Please review the changes at your earliest convenience.</p>
